        "original_id": "44adfad4-94cc-5e80-877a-15a4009abc40",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Spice Girls\n- People: Melanie Brown, Melanie Chisholm, Emma Bunton, Geri Halliwell, Victoria Beckham, Geraldine Estelle Horner\n- Roles: Scary Spice, Sporty Spice, Baby Spice, Ginger Spice, Posh Spice\n- Topics: group membership, personal identity\n\nFacts:\n- The Spice Girls originally consisted of Melanie Brown, Melanie Chisholm, Emma Bunton, Geri Halliwell, and Victoria Beckham.\n- Melanie Brown was known in the Spice Girls as \"Scary Spice.\"\n- Melanie Chisholm was known in the Spice Girls as \"Sporty Spice.\"\n- Emma Bunton was known in the Spice Girls as \"Baby Spice.\"\n- Geri Halliwell was known in the Spice Girls as \"Ginger Spice.\"\n- Victoria Beckham, née Adams, was known in the Spice Girls as \"Posh Spice.\"\n- Geraldine Estelle Horner, née Halliwell and known as Geri Halliwell, was born on 6 August 1972.\n- Geri Halliwell is an English pop singer-songwriter, clothes designer, author, and actress.",
